          "name": "multiline_label_before_placing_down_your_blocks",
          "text": "Before placing anything important, I need to claim a home for my restaurant.\nThe Golden Spatula can reveal a 5x5 piece of land. A green outline means the spot is free, and I can make it the beginning of my restaurant.\nWhen I am done, sneaking and right-clicking puts my spatula back to normal.",
