        "data": {
          "name": "multiline_label_after_that_you_can_claim_3_more",
          "text": "I can claim up to four areas at the start. My Reception, Service Tables and Chairs only count when they stand inside this space.\nAs my restaurant grows, I will be able to claim more land. For once, success comes with extra floor space.",
